    output_path: Path,
) -> None:
    text = f"""# V4 background and subtitle style exploration

This folder contains {len(entries)} image variants built from the last short style.

The matrix is rendered at 1536 x 1920 for fast comparison. The selected frames are rendered at the canonical 3072 x 3840 portrait size. The MOV lasts {PARAMS['movie_seconds']} seconds at {PARAMS['fps']} fps and shows the blue layer first, then the red layer, with static backgrounds, a crossfade, line-by-line Canon subtitle timing, and subtitle fade out.

Title variants: SF Pro Display Bold, Alize Bold Caps, and GT Sectra Bold, all in Caps Lock and scaled by 1.25.

Title colors: V3 gradient, white, and gray.

Subtitle template: {SUBTITLE_FONTS[ACTIVE_SUBTITLE_KEY]['label']}.

Subtitle colors: white, yellow, #81e1fb for blue, and #ec7972 for red.

The canonical source names are `blue_layer_01.png`, `red_layer_02.png`, and `black_layer_04.png`. The prepared copies and alpha masks live in `background-assets/`.

Files:

